{"id":"julio","lemma":"julio","pos":"noun","rank":1732,"glosses":["July"],"ipa":"/ˈxuljo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"julios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-julio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella dará a luz en julio.","en":"She will give birth in July.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"light"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Ellos estaban de vacaciones el julio pasado.","en":"They were on vacation last July.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"vacation, holiday","l":"vacación"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"past"}]},{"text":"Vengo aquí cada cuatro de julio.","en":"I come here every Fourth of July.","words":[{"g":"to avenge","l":"vengar"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"each"},{"g":"a four-stringed guitar…"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Él nació el día 28 de julio de 1888.","en":"He was born on July 28th, 1888.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589845","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be born","l":"nacer"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"day"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"of / from"}]},{"text":"Suele hacer calor en julio.","en":"The weather is usually hot in July.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687785","words":[{"g":"to be accustomed to…","l":"soler"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"heat"},{"g":"in / on"},null]}]}